{"id":"n28814-1-8","stage":2,"title":"마찬가지 · 相同","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28814-1-8-1","ko":"강아지 털을 다 깎아 줬네?","zh":"狗狗的毛都剪完啦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"강아지","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"털을","meaning":"毛，毛发","explanation":"털：毛，毛发；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"털","audio":"/audio/42a3dc233fdf099ce033.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71477","senseId":"1","lemma":"털","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깎아","meaning":"剪","explanation":"깎다：剪；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57278","senseId":"2","lemma":"깎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬네?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"42a3dc233fdf099c","term":"털","zh":"毛，毛发","audio":"/audio/42a3dc233fdf099ce033.mp3","entryId":"71477","definition":"人或动物皮肤上生长的纤细的线状物。","pronunciation":["털"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"18d3575b885757d9","term":"깎다","zh":"剪","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3","entryId":"57278","definition":"把草或毛等切短。","pronunciation":["깍따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c858c3cc1d9a247da84.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28814-1-8-2","ko":"응. 여름에 동물도 덥기는 마찬가지거든.","zh":"嗯。毕竟夏天动物也会觉得热啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여름에","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동물도","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덥기는","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마찬가지거든.","meaning":"相同，一样","explanation":"마찬가지：相同，一样；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"마찬가지","audio":"/audio/c61fbe207e8136d7dc53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28814","senseId":"1","lemma":"마찬가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"c61fbe207e8136d7","term":"마찬가지","zh":"相同，一样","audio":"/audio/c61fbe207e8136d7dc53.mp3","entryId":"28814","definition":"两个以上物体的形状或事情的状况没有差异。","pronunciation":["마찬가지"]}],"audio":"/audio/29ffeb07cce209a3ea0c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28814","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。毕竟夏天动物也会觉得热啊。","狗狗的毛都剪完啦？","照片里的风景真的非常漂亮，对吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["狗狗的毛都剪完啦？","照片里的风景真的非常漂亮，对吧？","嗯。毕竟夏天动物也会觉得热啊。"],"answer":2}]}
